{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-scoring","title":"风险评分与决策引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/risk-and-fraud/risk-scoring","wordCount":1389,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"风险评分与决策引擎\">风险评分与决策引擎</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>风险评分（Risk Scoring）将每笔交易的多维度风险信号综合为一个可量化的分数（通常 0-100 或 0-1000），用于驱动自动化的通过/拒绝/审核决策。评分引擎是连接数据采集层和业务决策层的核心枢纽，需要平衡欺诈防控和用户体验两个相互冲突的目标。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[风险信号] --&gt; B[评分模型]&#10;    B --&gt; C[综合评分]&#10;    C --&gt; D{决策引擎}&#10;    D --&gt;|0-30分| E[自动通过]&#10;    D --&gt;|30-70分| F[增强验证]&#10;    D --&gt;|70-100分| G[自动拒绝]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[3DS 挑战]&#10;    F --&gt; F2[人工审核]&#10;    G --&gt; G1[拉黑处理]&#10;    E --&gt; H[交易完成]&#10;    F1 --&gt; H&#10;    F2 --&gt; H\">graph LR\n    A[风险信号] --&gt; B[评分模型]\n    B --&gt; C[综合评分]\n    C --&gt; D{决策引擎}\n    D --&gt;|0-30分| E[自动通过]\n    D --&gt;|30-70分| F[增强验证]\n    D --&gt;|70-100分| G[自动拒绝]\n    F --&gt; F1[3DS 挑战]\n    F --&gt; F2[人工审核]\n    G --&gt; G1[拉黑处理]\n    E --&gt; H[交易完成]\n    F1 --&gt; H\n    F2 --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评分区间</th>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n<th>典型占比</th>\n<th>欺诈率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0-30</td>\n<td>低风险</td>\n<td>自动通过</td>\n<td>75-85%</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30-50</td>\n<td>中低风险</td>\n<td>宽松验证</td>\n<td>8-12%</td>\n<td>0.1-0.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50-70</td>\n<td>中高风险</td>\n<td>严格验证/人工审核</td>\n<td>3-8%</td>\n<td>0.5-5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70-100</td>\n<td>高风险</td>\n<td>自动拒绝</td>\n<td>2-5%</td>\n<td>&gt;10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"评分模型架构\">评分模型架构</h2><p>评分模型通常采用集成学习（Ensemble）架构，将多个子模型的输出加权融合为最终评分。子模型各有侧重：规则子评分覆盖已知欺诈模式，ML 子评分捕捉复杂的非线性关系，速率子评分检测异常频率，网络子评分识别关联风险。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RiskScoreComponents {&#10;  ruleScore: {&#10;    score: number;&#10;    weight: 0.25;&#10;    triggeredRules: string[];&#10;  };&#10;  mlScore: {&#10;    score: number;&#10;    weight: 0.35;&#10;    modelVersion: string;&#10;    topFeatures: { name: string; shap: number }[];&#10;  };&#10;  velocityScore: {&#10;    score: number;&#10;    weight: 0.2;&#10;    anomalies: string[];&#10;  };&#10;  networkScore: {&#10;    score: number;&#10;    weight: 0.2;&#10;    riskFactors: string[];&#10;  };&#10;  finalScore: number;&#10;  confidence: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const calculateFinalScore = (components: RiskScoreComponents): number =&gt; {&#10;  const weighted =&#10;    components.ruleScore.score * components.ruleScore.weight +&#10;    components.mlScore.score * components.mlScore.weight +&#10;    components.velocityScore.score * components.velocityScore.weight +&#10;    components.networkScore.score * components.networkScore.weight;&#10;  return Math.round(Math.min(100, Math.max(0, weighted)));&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RiskScoreComponents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ruleScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    triggeredRules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  mlScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    modelVersion</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    topFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">shap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  velocityScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    anomalies</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  networkScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    score</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    riskFactors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  finalScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  confidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateFinalScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">components</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RiskScoreComponents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> weighted</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    components.ruleScore.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components.ruleScore.weight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    components.mlScore.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components.mlScore.weight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    components.velocityScore.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components.velocityScore.weight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    components.networkScore.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> components.networkScore.weight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, weighted)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模型的可解释性至关重要。当交易被拒绝或触发人工审核时，审核人员需要知道是哪些因素导致了高分。SHAP（SHapley Additive exPlanations）值为每个特征提供量化的贡献度，让风控团队理解模型的决策逻辑。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可解释方法</th>\n<th>适用模型</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>解释粒度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SHAP</td>\n<td>所有模型</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>样本级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LIME</td>\n<td>所有模型</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>样本级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特征重要性</td>\n<td>树模型</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>全局级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力权重</td>\n<td>深度学习</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>样本级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"决策引擎设计\">决策引擎设计</h2><p>决策引擎根据风险评分和业务规则执行最终的交易处置。决策策略需要在&quot;通过率&quot;和&quot;欺诈率&quot;之间找到最优平衡点。通过率过低会丢失合法订单（误拒成本），欺诈率过高会产生拒付和赔付损失。</p>\n<p>决策阈值的设定方法：首先确定业务可接受的欺诈率上限（如 0.1%），然后在历史数据上调整阈值使欺诈率不超过上限的同时最大化通过率。不同业务线可能有不同的风险容忍度——数字商品（即时交付、不可追回）比实物商品需要更严格的阈值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DecisionPolicy {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  merchantCategory: string;&#10;  thresholds: {&#10;    autoApprove: number;&#10;    softDecline: number;&#10;    hardDecline: number;&#10;  };&#10;  actions: {&#10;    approve: { executeCapture: boolean };&#10;    challenge: {&#10;      methods: (&#39;3ds&#39; | &#39;otp&#39; | &#39;manual_review&#39;)[];&#10;      timeout: number;&#10;      fallbackAction: &#39;approve&#39; | &#39;decline&#39;;&#10;    };&#10;    decline: {&#10;      responseCode: string;&#10;      retryAllowed: boolean;&#10;      blacklistDevice: boolean;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  overrides: {&#10;    trustedCustomers: { maxScore: number; action: &#39;approve&#39; };&#10;    highValueOrders: { minAmount: number; additionalVerification: boolean };&#10;    newCustomers: { scoreAdjustment: number };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DecisionPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  merchantCategory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  thresholds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    autoApprove</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    softDecline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    hardDecline</span><span style=\"